Seedance 2.0 Prompt:

NO MUSIC ONLY NATURAL SOUND — Epic blockbuster fantasy, shot on ARRI Alexa 65 with IMAX-scale anamorphic lenses, warm golden-hour daylight breaking through canyon haze, drifting mist and volumetric god-rays, grounded handheld energy on the run building to a sweeping aerial glide in flight.

The sweeping rocky valley (
@Image3
) tiered waterfalls spilling down the cliffs, scattered pines, a winding dirt trail across the canyon floor, tall sandstone mesas dissolving into low mist. Side tracking shot moving parallel to ERYAN (
@Image1
) as he sprints in profile across the dirt trail, low on his feet pounding the ground and kicking up dust and grit, then easing back to hold his full body in frame — a lean young man in a tattered beige linen tunic belted with a wide leather sash, black wavy hair and green eyes, lower legs wrapped in cloth bindings, driving toward a jutting rock outcrop. Staying lateral with him, he hits the lip and launches off the edge into open air over the valley.

Slow motion at the peak of the leap, held in side profile — his body suspended against the waterfalls far below, tunic and hair lifting, arms spread. The forward momentum of the jump carries him into a long downward arc, still traveling forward as he drops — and in that same motion THE GRIFFIN (
@Image
2 — eagle head with dark brown plumage and tufted ears, pale eyes, hooked gray beak, black-brown wings and tawny lion hindquarters, leather saddle and braided rope reins — sweeps up from below in a rush of wingbeats and slides beneath him mid-arc, catching him on its back. Return to real time as ERYAN
@Image
1 settles onto the saddle, grabs the rope reins in both fists, and the griffin banks hard into flight.

Dynamic flight: wide aerial as THE GRIFFIN
@Image
2 sweeps down the canyon between the cliff walls, wingtips skimming a cascading waterfall, spray misting off its feathers. Cut to a tight side-profile tracking shot of ERYAN
@Image
1 leaning low over the griffin's neck, wind tearing at his hair, a wide grin breaking across his face, breath visible. Cut to a low hero shot of THE GRIFFIN
@Image
2 from ahead, wings at full span, powerful downbeats, eyes fixed forward. Cut to an over-the-shoulder from behind ERYAN as the valley opens ahead — waterfalls, pines and misted mesas streaming past below. The griffin rises through a shaft of golden light and levels into a long glide over the ridge.

Faces, wardrobe, feather patterns and proportions locked to the reference sheets, lighting and landscape matched to
@Image
3. SFX: pounding footsteps and scattering grit, the whoosh of the leap, a heavy thunder of wingbeats, rushing wind, distant waterfall roar, Eryan's laughing breath, creaking saddle leather. Cinematic 4K, subtle filmic grain, accurate feather and cloth physics, natural motion, no music, no text, no watermark, no CGI plasticity

